# Agent working files. CLAUDE.md is instructions for AI assistants working on
# this repo, not documentation for contributors — CONTRIBUTING.md and the
# docs/plans/ specs are the human-facing versions. Listed explicitly rather
# than relying on `.claude/` matching it, which only happens to work because
# core.ignorecase is true on this filesystem and would not on Linux or CI.
.claude/
/CLAUDE.md
